Warp-specialized persistent W2 metadata-index correctness repair
Date: 2026-09-03

Root cause:
The first eight consumer threads initialized route_ids[0..7] and activation
scales with route indexed by token_slot=consumer_tid/16.  For consumer_tid
0..7, token_slot is always zero, so every metadata row was route 0.  The
activation tile gather itself correctly used token_slot in groups of sixteen.
The repair independently indexes metadata with consumer_tid.

